38 < 1 - Run: python3 -c "from ledger.core import biggest_memo; assert biggest_memo('2026-09-01,rent,-5000,landlord\n2026-09-02,card,900,pay\n') == 'landlord'" [M1]
39 < 1 - Legs: (a) the memo of the entry furthest from zero, where that entry is money going out [M1].
